  "details": "Issue: When scrolling on the Friend Locations tab in the Social Menu, locations and friends may repeat when scrolling.\n\nRepro: There is not a clear solution on triggering a guaranteed reproduction.\n\nSteps:\n\n1. Open the VRChat client\n\n2. Enable the Quick Menu\n\n3. Click the Social tab\n\n4. Choose \"Friend Locations\" under the Social tab\n\n5. Scrolling up and down on a long list may cause repetition\n\nObservations:\n\n-This happened only once, on Saturday night during peak VRChat hours\n\n-My friend locations stated 28 available friends/locations, so reproducing may require a large amount of available friends\n\n-Restarting fixed this issue",
